<h2>1. Introduction & Data Controller</h2>
<p><strong>[COMPANY NAME]</strong> ("[COMPANY NAME]", "we", "us", or "our") operates the website www.[DOMAIN] (the "Service").</p>

<p>This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and process your personal data in accordance with the EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR/DSGVO).</p>

<p><strong>Data Controller</strong><br>
