<h2>2. Data We Collect & Why</h2>

<h3>2.1 Rental Request Data</h3>
<p><strong>When you submit a rental request through our catalog, we collect:</strong></p>
<ul>
  <li>Your full name</li>
  <li>Your email address</li>
  <li>Event type (wedding, birthday, corporate, etc.)</li>
  <li>Event date</li>
  <li>Items selected and quantities</li>
  <li>Any additional message or notes</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Legal Basis (GDPR Art. 6):</strong> Contract performance – we need this data to process your rental request, send quotes, and provide service.</p>

<h3>2.2 Admin Access Data</h3>
<p>When administrators log in via passwordless email links, we collect and store:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Admin email address</li>
  <li>Login timestamps and session information</li>
  <li>Actions performed in the admin panel (catalog edits, request confirmations, etc.)</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Legal Basis:</strong> Contract performance and legitimate interest in securing the admin panel.</p>

<h3>2.3 Server Logs</h3>
<p>Like all websites, our server automatically logs:</p>
<ul>
  <li>IP address</li>
  <li>Browser type and version</li>
  <li>Pages visited and time spent</li>
  <li>Referrer URL</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Legal Basis:</strong> Legitimate interest in website security and performance monitoring.</p>

<h2>3. How We Use Your Data</h2>
<p>We use your personal data only for the following purposes:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Process rental requests:</strong> Send you quotes, confirmations, and rental details</li>
  <li><strong>Contact you:</strong> About your request via email (as per your request)</li>
  <li><strong>Improve our service:</strong> Analyze aggregated usage patterns (never individual data)</li>
  <li><strong>Comply with legal obligations:</strong> Tax records, contract archives</li>
  <li><strong>Protect against fraud/security threats:</strong> Investigate unauthorized access</li>
</ul>

<p><strong>We do NOT:</strong></p>
<ul>
  <li>Sell your data to third parties</li>
  <li>Share your data for marketing purposes without consent</li>
  <li>Use tracking cookies or analytics services that profile you</li>
  <li>Send unsolicited marketing emails</li>
</ul>

<h2>4. Data Retention</h2>
<p>We retain your personal data only as long as necessary:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Rental requests:</strong> Stored indefinitely for business history (you can request deletion anytime)</li>
  <li><strong>Admin accounts:</strong> For the duration of their admin role + 6 months after transfer</li>
  <li><strong>Server logs:</strong> Automatically purged after 30 days</li>
  <li><strong>Audit logs:</strong> Retained for 90 days, then automatically deleted</li>
</ul>

<h2>5. Your Rights Under GDPR (Art. 15-22)</h2>

<h3>5.1 Right of Access (Art. 15)</h3>
<p>You have the right to request a copy of all personal data we hold about you. We will provide this within 30 days.</p>

<h3>5.2 Right to Rectification (Art. 16)</h3>
<p>You can request that we correct or update any inaccurate personal data.</p>

<h3>5.3 Right to Erasure / "Right to be Forgotten" (Art. 17)</h3>
<p>You can request that we delete all your personal data, including rental request history. We will comply within 30 days (except where legal obligations require us to retain records).</p>

<h3>5.4 Right to Data Portability (Art. 20)</h3>
<p>You can request your data in a portable format (JSON or CSV). <a href="/gdpr/export">Export your data here</a>.</p>

<h3>5.5 Right to Object (Art. 21)</h3>
<p>You can object to certain processing. For rental data, you can request not to receive future emails about requests.</p>

<h2>6. Data Processors & Subprocessors (Art. 28)</h2>

<h3>6.1 Service Providers</h3>
