</ul>

<p><strong>Response Time:</strong> We will respond to all GDPR requests within 30 days (extendable by 2 months for complex requests).</p>

<h2>11. Supervisory Authority</h2>
<p>You have the right to lodge a complaint with your local data protection authority if you believe we have violated your privacy rights. In Germany, contact your state's Datenschutzbehörde.</p>

<h2>12. Changes to This Policy</h2>
<p>We may update this Privacy Policy periodically. We will notify you of material changes via email and update the "Last Updated" date below.</p>

